%% UC-18 — Manage participants
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Researcher / Admin
    participant AP as Admin Panel
    participant B as Backend (adminParticipantService)
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant KC as Keycloak (Admin API)

    R->>AP: Open Participants page
    AP->>B: GET /api/v1/admin/participants
    B->>M: find(participants, {deletedAt: null}) + enrollment join
    M-->>B: participant list + progress
    B-->>AP: participants
    R->>AP: Create / edit / soft-delete participant
    alt create
        AP->>B: POST /api/v1/admin/participants
        B->>KC: Create Keycloak user (role user, group attribute)
        B->>M: insert(participants)
    else soft-delete
        AP->>B: DELETE /api/v1/admin/participants/:id
        B->>M: $set {deletedAt: now}
        B->>KC: Disable Keycloak user
    end
    B-->>AP: 200 / 201
